Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twentieth Episode\NThe Shadow Eaters\NMonster Kagera
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And what song would you like to hear next?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's everyone going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.18,0:02:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.49,0:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to hear a story from the old man in the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with us, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I love stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.56,0:02:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Don't I have sheep-herding duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I just have to play, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't glare at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, what story should I tell you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.49,0:03:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a pirate story!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a story about a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me a story too...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, no need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.09,0:03:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to tend the sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go back right after the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time, so hurry up and get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, is it okay to ditch your work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, now that everyone's here, shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, today I'll tell you the story of how shadows came to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, back when few living creatures walked the earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,humans, horses, rabbits, every living thing was terribly lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was all alone without any friends, so they did nothing but cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that, they were always weak and falling ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.37,0:04:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Worried by this, God thought that making them good friends would cure their sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He spent two seconds thinking of a good idea—and finally got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The child who received a friend danced for joy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but someone greedy stole that friend away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Troubled, God thought for three whole seconds this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Slapping his knee, an idea struck him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And he attached the friend directly to the child's feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.76,0:04:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From then on, no one could steal it away,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and it became an inseparable friend to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's how shadows came to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the friend that stays closest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a stray sheep over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you're hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That little guy gets lost so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.39,0:05:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It ate a sheep's shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shadow-eating monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.55,0:06:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a house over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:06:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make a sound and stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.47,0:07:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.67,0:07:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Put something against that window too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That window, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous if it breaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not safe here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone run while I fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell into a hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell through that old well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mom! Help! Mama!\N- Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.27,0:08:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's eating my shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fascinating monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The males eat the boys' shadows, and the females eat the girls'!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set this monster on Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.04,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:08:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow tastes awful, you won't like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.89,0:09:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.07,0:09:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink it's the prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried after falling down here, but now I can relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you ended up saving me instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.68,0:09:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster ate our shadows...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A shadow-eating monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.51,0:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a monster called Kagera. It's a creature that eats animals' shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It was originally a giant slug living in a pond...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what happens to the children whose shadows were eaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,According to records, the same thing happened 500 years ago, and the children died the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Died?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.69,0:10:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way to save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've evacuated all the children in town to the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.97,0:10:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We must protect these children at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's heading right for the town!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:11:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the male monster attacks men, while the female attacks women.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, the one targeting Sapphire was the female Kagera...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The female Kagera?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If we fire the cannons now, the town will be ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to think of another way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.55,0:11:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Another way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll act as a decoy and lure that monster to the mountains!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.64,0:11:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, I'll accompany you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm curious to see which Kagera targets Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.82,0:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The male Kagera targets boys, and the female targets girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which Kagera will go after Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The male Kagera isn't following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get on behind me, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Head up into the mountains!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run toward the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kagera is heading for the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kagera!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fighting me, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that Prince Sapphire! He's completely cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gobble him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together,\Nwe're almost there Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bite him right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to save Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, we need to get close, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll defeat the monster and get everyone's shadows back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never held anything this heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My pinky hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The one that targeted Sapphire was the female Kagera!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A child is crying in the plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's Lord Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My son?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:14:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That crying sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.19,0:15:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That really is my son, Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone please save my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What, what, what...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow is gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic's shadow was taken!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic, come over here quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,, fell asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.34,0:15:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My son!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My son!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My son, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.69,0:16:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My son was targeted too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Kagera?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.14,0:16:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're sleeping over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the sun went away and shadows disappeared, they're taking a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, did you find a way to get the shadows back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there is a way, but it's terrible. It's completely out of the question—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,, I don't care what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, basically... it seems that if we defeat the Kagera, our shadows will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They say only a demon can defeat Kagera.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, to defeat Kagera, offer what the demon wants most as a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the demon will get rid of Kagera for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it says in this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.47,0:16:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the demon wants most?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto, King of Demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire calls for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire has come for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the torch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will hear what you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you have a favor to ask of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing in this world Demon King Mephisto cannot do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Though the heavens burn and the earth splits, we demons shall never perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Demon King Mephisto exists, we are eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, out with this favor of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to defeat the monster Kagera!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.56,0:17:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kagera?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems even Sapphire is having trouble with that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:18:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Sapphire, I'll defeat it, but in return...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you my boy's heart that you want so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Spoken like a true prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.19,0:18:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and defeat Kagera!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And bring back Sapphire's boy's heart on your way back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.37,0:18:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have a pretty good idea that Sapphire is a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what happened while you were dilly-dallying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do about this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.47,0:18:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is coming out again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The monsters have awakened!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You useless, brainless fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Behind... Behind you! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm furious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as our shadows don't show, it won't chase us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lure Kagera out from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowpoke monster Kagera, come get us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch us if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.79,0:19:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.61,0:19:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off your horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.30,0:19:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our shadows are getting so heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me quietly back away from here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe my shadow stayed behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about to get interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch!
Comment: 0,0:19:49.99,0:19:51.30,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Zuborasha!
Comment: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:58.24,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Borasha!
Comment: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:03.16,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sora, Haora, Paora, Zuborasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough!
Comment: 0,0:20:06.91,0:20:08.28,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Zuborasha!
Comment: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:10.12,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Zuborasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this sugar water?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What good is making sugar water?
Comment: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:18.38,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Zuborasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.69,0:20:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Paint the sugar water onto Kagera's shadow with that brush!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.99,0:20:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's sugar water going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished painting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to finally defeat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Comment: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.44,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Zuborasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It started eating the shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.09,0:21:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.11,0:21:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't even realize it's their own shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, that sugar water is about to turn into salt water!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamera is a slug monster, so salt will melt it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:22:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow is back! Hooray!\NHooray! How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shadow is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.99,0:22:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic is saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.46,0:22:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.64,0:22:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Plastic was saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.54,0:22:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He was saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Hecate, take my heart as promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.76,0:22:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get close to you!
Comment: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:27.02,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,karaoke,Zuborasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.85,0:22:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on this and come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.83,0:22:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.01,0:22:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A demon took Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.84,0:22:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward to this day!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.91,0:22:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.72,0:22:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.82,0:22:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.50,0:22:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.14,0:22:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:22:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's night!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.36,0:22:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:22:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't take Sapphire's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.82,0:23:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.77,0:23:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We defeated Kagira!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.51,0:23:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking Sapphire's heart is only right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you my heart instead of Sapphire's!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.07,0:23:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.11,0:23:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.84,0:23:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is going numb!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.53,0:23:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.26,0:23:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.15,0:23:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine just as I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We both made it out safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.71,0:23:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.70,0:23:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.86,0:23:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,goodbye!
Comment: 0,0:23:56.34,0:23:59.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Comment: 0,0:23:59.96,0:24:03.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Comment: 0,0:23:59.96,0:24:03.32,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
